WEBVTT

00:00:07.134 --> 00:00:09.720
-What you need is more fiber.
-He's right.

00:00:16.477 --> 00:00:17.561
(exclaiming)

00:00:17.645 --> 00:00:18.729
(laughs joyfully)

00:00:18.812 --> 00:00:21.649
Shangri Llama's back on top, baby!

00:00:21.732 --> 00:00:24.276
-Ooh. Ah! Mmm.
-(gasps)

00:00:27.238 --> 00:00:28.239
Gladys?

00:00:30.157 --> 00:00:32.826
Well, hello Teddy Bear!

00:00:34.453 --> 00:00:36.080
Mmm-hmm.

00:00:36.163 --> 00:00:40.000
Hot tubbin' just got a whole lot hotter.

00:00:40.501 --> 00:00:44.421
Amazing! It's like some kind of
"Fountain of Never Getting Old!"

00:00:45.172 --> 00:00:47.132
Well, we can workshop the name later.

00:00:47.758 --> 00:00:49.468
(sighs)

00:00:52.513 --> 00:00:54.181
(indistinct chatter)

00:01:01.647 --> 00:01:03.524
Where's the bride?
Why don't I have the bride?

00:01:03.607 --> 00:01:05.567
'Cause you're talking into a twig.

00:01:05.651 --> 00:01:06.777
(groans) Mom, I can't talk.
I'm at a wedding.

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:07.903
WOMAN: What do you mean you can't talk?

00:01:07.987 --> 00:01:08.946
Who are you with?

00:01:09.029 --> 00:01:10.781
Um, excuse me.

00:01:10.864 --> 00:01:14.076
Is it true you helped save
the world from an asteroid?

00:01:14.159 --> 00:01:15.786
Um...

00:01:15.869 --> 00:01:18.289
That's a very scary story.

00:01:18.372 --> 00:01:19.707
You think you can handle it?

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:21.208
BOTH: Yeah.

00:01:21.292 --> 00:01:22.376
How scary?

00:01:22.876 --> 00:01:23.919
-Well, we were... Oh!
-Oh!

00:01:24.003 --> 00:01:25.296
Hi! (chuckles)

00:01:25.379 --> 00:01:26.797
It was five minutes to midnight

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:28.716
and we were up against volcanoes,

00:01:28.799 --> 00:01:30.759
dino-birds, and the end of the world.

00:01:30.843 --> 00:01:33.429
Oh, and the zombies!
Don't forget the zombies!

00:01:33.512 --> 00:01:36.015
You know, we'd be great parents.

00:01:37.016 --> 00:01:39.518
So I turn to Bigfoot, and I say,
"Listen, big guy..."

00:01:40.853 --> 00:01:43.647
I don't know. I don't know!
What am I gonna do?

00:01:43.731 --> 00:01:47.109
Sweetie, listen to me. This is normal, okay?

00:01:47.192 --> 00:01:48.485
Everyone gets nervous.

00:01:48.569 --> 00:01:49.737
What's going on? What happened?

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:50.904
PEACHES: It's just...

00:01:50.988 --> 00:01:54.158
I can't go. How can I go?

00:01:54.241 --> 00:01:56.076
I don't wanna leave you guys.

00:02:00.831 --> 00:02:02.791
Hey, Fuzzball,

00:02:02.875 --> 00:02:05.169
remember the first time
that we played hockey?

00:02:05.252 --> 00:02:08.255
You were so afraid to get on the ice
because it was slippery?

00:02:09.757 --> 00:02:12.343
Remember how I held you up
while you started to skate?

00:02:12.426 --> 00:02:14.887
And when I knew
you were ready, I let you go.

00:02:15.429 --> 00:02:17.765
(sighs) Aw, Dad.

00:02:17.848 --> 00:02:21.101
I know you're ready. Now you have to let go.

00:02:21.185 --> 00:02:23.645
I always knew it would take
someone very special

00:02:23.729 --> 00:02:25.022
to match your spirit.

00:02:25.105 --> 00:02:28.025
And you found him. Just like I did.

00:02:28.108 --> 00:02:29.860
It's your time, sweetie.

00:02:29.943 --> 00:02:31.945
See the world, chase your dreams.

00:02:32.863 --> 00:02:34.907
MANNY: And whenever you decide
to come back

00:02:35.366 --> 00:02:37.284
we'll be here, okay?

00:02:37.368 --> 00:02:38.452
(chuckles)

00:02:47.294 --> 00:02:48.921
Okay.

00:02:49.797 --> 00:02:51.048
Oh. (laughs)

00:02:53.926 --> 00:02:55.260
(all gasping)

00:03:26.917 --> 00:03:28.210
Do you...

00:03:28.293 --> 00:03:29.378
I do.

00:03:29.461 --> 00:03:30.712
And do you...

00:03:30.796 --> 00:03:32.131
Most def.

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:35.259
I now pronounce you...

00:03:35.342 --> 00:03:36.844
(all cheering)

00:03:40.973 --> 00:03:41.974
(sighs)

00:03:50.149 --> 00:03:51.150
(gasps)

00:03:52.359 --> 00:03:53.735
(gasps) Sid!

00:03:53.819 --> 00:03:55.028
Brooke!

00:04:02.035 --> 00:04:03.829
(both laughing)

00:04:04.538 --> 00:04:05.998
Oh! Whoa! Ow!

00:04:06.081 --> 00:04:07.082
Oops!

00:04:07.166 --> 00:04:08.750
This is amazing!

00:04:08.834 --> 00:04:11.628
You're young again.
And somehow, I'm still single.

00:04:11.712 --> 00:04:14.214
I guess the universe was smiling on us.

00:04:14.298 --> 00:04:16.091
I have so many questions for you.

00:04:16.175 --> 00:04:18.302
What happened? How'd you find me?

00:04:18.385 --> 00:04:19.636
Have you tried the shrimp?

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:23.390
Shh. Close that pretty little mouth of yours
and just listen.

00:04:24.141 --> 00:04:27.853
This is dedicated to the sloth of my dreams.

00:04:28.312 --> 00:04:30.481
That guy? For real?

00:04:30.564 --> 00:04:35.486
♪ Oh
Oh, Sid ♪

00:04:35.569 --> 00:04:37.404
♪ Sid, baby ♪

00:04:38.071 --> 00:04:41.909
♪ You make me so happy ♪

00:04:43.577 --> 00:04:45.787
♪ Oh I never knew I
Would make it out ♪

00:04:45.871 --> 00:04:48.790
♪ And come this far
Oh I never knew I ♪

00:04:48.874 --> 00:04:51.752
♪ Would see the day
We come together ♪

00:04:51.835 --> 00:04:54.087
♪ Oh, it's not like anything
I've ever ♪

00:04:54.171 --> 00:04:55.172
-Whoa!
-(MUSIC STOPS)

00:04:56.173 --> 00:04:57.925
-(all gasp)
-(faints)

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:00.511
(music resumes)

00:05:00.594 --> 00:05:01.845
♪ You ♪

00:05:01.929 --> 00:05:03.013
♪ You make me happy ♪

00:05:03.722 --> 00:05:05.516
♪ You keep me laughing ♪

00:05:05.599 --> 00:05:08.685
♪ You make my world a better place ♪

00:05:08.769 --> 00:05:10.354
♪ My superstar
My superstar ♪

00:05:10.437 --> 00:05:12.856
♪ You shine so bright
Into my heart ♪

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:14.608
♪ My superstar
My superstar ♪

00:05:14.691 --> 00:05:16.818
♪ You shine so bright
Into my heart ♪

00:05:16.902 --> 00:05:19.947
♪ My super crew
Stick together like super glue ♪

00:05:20.030 --> 00:05:22.032
♪ We got the moves like yeah ♪

00:05:22.115 --> 00:05:23.283
♪ We're shining bright ♪

00:05:23.367 --> 00:05:25.118
♪ Throw your hands up to the blue sky ♪

00:05:25.786 --> 00:05:28.539
♪ You
You make me happy ♪

00:05:28.622 --> 00:05:29.706
Sid?

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:30.874
I never thought I'd say this,

00:05:30.958 --> 00:05:32.543
but you did a great job on the wedding.

00:05:32.626 --> 00:05:34.044
I owe you bigtime, pal.

00:05:34.127 --> 00:05:35.504
You sure do.

00:05:35.587 --> 00:05:37.297
-Here's my bill.
-What?

00:05:37.381 --> 00:05:39.174
Father of the bride pays for the wedding.

00:05:39.258 --> 00:05:40.801
It's a tradition I just invented.

00:05:40.884 --> 00:05:42.386
Wait a minute, this is ridiculous.

00:05:42.469 --> 00:05:44.012
Look what you're charging for flowers!

00:05:44.096 --> 00:05:45.305
Flowers ain't cheap.

00:05:45.389 --> 00:05:47.891
No! They're free! We're in a forest!

00:05:47.975 --> 00:05:49.142
This bill is outrageous!

